chapter_1_bd8fa6dd		You remember the time you spent looking to impress your parents who decided to visit just in the wrong time.	game/chapter-1.rpy	29	"[what]"
chapter_1_59b0bf3d	n	“Ahh… about that, I’m deeply sorry I have made the gods wait for my return.”	game/chapter-1.rpy	30	n "[what]"
chapter_1_b6e54020	n	“My parents came at a time of hardship for both me and Lulu and I had to turn my full attention to them.”	game/chapter-1.rpy	31	n "[what]"
chapter_1_4fd2ec5a	n	“I guess the other priests didn’t tell you.”	game/chapter-1.rpy	32	n "[what]"
