chapter_2_58ed8491		Crying was not enough; he had to do something to free his lover from them; he had the urge to beat them, crush them, and even set them ablaze, for he would do everything to protect his Nabi.	game/chapter-2.rpy	21	"[what]"
chapter_2_bb8443e8		There was a sudden gush of air, and the ground felt like collapsing under him. No one heard it, but Lulu had tripped over his own feet.	game/chapter-2.rpy	22	"[what]"
chapter_2_875bda65		The ground felt much less painful than all the feelings bubbling inside him; an unfamiliar sound echoed through his skull.	game/chapter-2.rpy	24	"[what]"
chapter_2_c1f9338f		A dark liquid started to drip once he groggily stood up. 	game/chapter-2.rpy	25	"[what]"
chapter_2_38ebceb9		Feeling pain, he groped the top of his head as if he knew what had happened.	game/chapter-2.rpy	26	"[what]"
